{"title":"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 30","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of real solutions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/c/a3c241a85b1ae78460fe652f86d41588f1c20639.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y,z,w)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"83\" height=\"20\" /> of the simultaneous equations\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/c/40ceb62b6fbc80f87ea85d5131f1fcc02fef23aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y = x + \\frac{17}{x}, 2z = y + \\frac{17}{y}, 2w = z + \\frac{17}{z}, 2x = w + \\frac{17}{w}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"419\" height=\"40\" />\nis\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/f/f5fd3ac5556e49b7c11968768d23ee658a1e282c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 2\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 4\\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ 8\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"357\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the cases <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/e/02e28efa00c4f2c66d1aa381c0cb1f8e0ef8d6e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/6/cd6ee81a7a535d87853e848c77654cc36104a75e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, and also note that by AM-GM, for any positive number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/8/a18f345d2de81339d3e7cd0729863cf8750a3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+\\frac{17}{a} \\geq 2\\sqrt{17}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"122\" height=\"38\" />, with equality only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/6/1c6201d283902fa5b1290fb348521f8ce1897606.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\sqrt{17}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />. Thus, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/e/02e28efa00c4f2c66d1aa381c0cb1f8e0ef8d6e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, considering each equation in turn, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/a/fda0bdce545a02fc2f55c9a865cb46530f6edf3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y \\geq \\sqrt{17}, z \\geq \\sqrt{17}, w \\geq \\sqrt{17}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"223\" height=\"23\" />, and finally <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/9/b59e224a2ad98515e6157b5ff095138a83329898.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\geq \\sqrt{17}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"68\" height=\"19\" />. \n</p><p>Now suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/061caa5a6443f7a99357ff5c300954946de22c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; \\sqrt{17}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/0/c20a9191a5ad83fef142f95101afe2635d62d50d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y - \\sqrt{17} = \\frac{x^{2}+17}{2x} - \\sqrt{17} = (\\frac{x-\\sqrt{17}}{2x})(x-\\sqrt{17}) &lt; \\frac{1}{2}(x-\\sqrt{17})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"511\" height=\"41\" />, so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/7/ab7da572d60053bdb3ab92f2dda44f87cd9dc78d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" />. Similarly, we can get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/c/f4c7e3f268dc89eeb7142a574114ab91a83cde9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y &gt; z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/3/f233413bfe7f86e95ae2bfa4718dd36036e0f373.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z &gt; w$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"46\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/d/f4de3b7a7da0b77bb9d25e7b1da1cc8e45f63279.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w &gt; x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"47\" height=\"10\" />, and combining these gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/c/30ce9093d520dd8e1c7b2b6842ca0e4fbd815857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"10\" />, an obvious contradiction.\n</p><p>Thus we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/9/b59e224a2ad98515e6157b5ff095138a83329898.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\geq \\sqrt{17}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"68\" height=\"19\" />, but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/8/4e83401375e5514144ce950890fe38f48a7a07b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\ngtr \\sqrt{17}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"21\" />, so if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/e/cae4fd68f44ac9b909f8d91f9d498de5759bb45b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, the only possibility is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/9/88964d9379aeba84af36c44b572c6c18018a2b56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\sqrt{17}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" />, and analogously from the other equations we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/5/b459292b412d8d51ddf1b1114e9c005e07278383.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = y = z = w = \\sqrt{17}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"173\" height=\"20\" />; indeed, by substituting, we verify that this works.\n</p><p>As for the other case, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/a/36a68e8aa6ec6f48231ad80a4851f84bacf641b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/c/a3c241a85b1ae78460fe652f86d41588f1c20639.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y,z,w)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"83\" height=\"20\" /> is a solution if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/b/edbc3578435b2e2d24c2099934ca8d32f6ca9067.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-x,-y,-z,-w)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"136\" height=\"18\" /> is a solution, since this just negates both sides of each equation and so they are equivalent. Thus the only other solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05e33fcef64dc52b8ab2039e7e59d320b15ea7a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = y = z = w = -\\sqrt{17}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"187\" height=\"20\" />, so that we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> solutions in total, and therefore the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2e33ab9a00e021af49e888212645d4667903c49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/7/d774a2943f75e7477a189fa1042bf11b7452a9e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b, c, d) = \\left(\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{17}}, \\frac{y}{\\sqrt{17}}, \\frac{z}{\\sqrt{17}}, \\frac{w}{\\sqrt{17}}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"299\" height=\"45\" />.  Then these equations become <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/2/2a28ab1cf142b59610f8883216c7d0a7b8b8b514.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b = a + \\frac{1}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"88\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/d/17dee041c7352cc85e8596911f4f769344ebe0bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2c = b + \\frac{1}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"86\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/1/9b18f8d2d673bf224401b77baee210782e7b6a6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2d = c + \\frac{1}{c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"88\" height=\"38\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/1/fc1246f2e4991b3babdbefd92eb4009028446f5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 2d + \\frac{1}{d}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" /> after substituting and cancelling.  Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8c31b328eb3b0252134a4720e161c0fdf641e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b, c, d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"75\" height=\"20\" /> must either all be positive or all be negative, and that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8c31b328eb3b0252134a4720e161c0fdf641e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b, c, d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"75\" height=\"20\" /> is a solution if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/5/1d555bd309e858d00cd34dbe70595815d53a081c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-a, -b, -c, -d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"132\" height=\"20\" /> is a solution.\n</p><p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8c31b328eb3b0252134a4720e161c0fdf641e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b, c, d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"75\" height=\"20\" /> are all positive.  Then by AM-GM, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/1/5a16d5a0a8c89bf21f98ccdb5c00e32e2135f00d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a = d + \\frac{1}{d} \\geq 2\\sqrt{d \\cdot \\frac{1}{d}} = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"210\" height=\"45\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/f/1ef200dd30dfcecd9b740ab356a29fb947b33a08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\geq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"14\" />.  By similar logic, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/3/b63a2a1fa5c863bd444640ad235bc7aa8ead4942.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\geq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/e/c8e779fb1ba1d7cc15b9d7893151b53fcc4486c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c \\geq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/5/28552db419b79aaf4d5c836002f2d974ca274a9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d \\geq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />.  Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/a/33a7c6b51ecaa6b7d77ded717e2da1dee4c023c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\geq \\frac{1}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"49\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/6/7765084a5efae7aa40b7b536319237e2cb7264ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\geq \\frac{1}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"47\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/2/a2255baf46093395c5d2cac523ddec19de605243.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c \\geq \\frac{1}{c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"47\" height=\"38\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/9/3e97685ddf04eae4ca771604955dbec038e4cc09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d \\geq \\frac{1}{d}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"49\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/b/a0b5e7bd3042c6f5644e36ccb9bcc2be0a0548bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a = d + \\frac{1}{d} \\leq 2d = c + \\frac{1}{c} \\leq 2c = b + \\frac{1}{b} \\leq 2b = a + \\frac{1}{a} \\leq 2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"462\" height=\"38\" />.  Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/3/fb3ff36a3bce42c32239dc72d76918f6640635d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\leq d \\leq c \\leq b \\leq a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"143\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/3/49314d1fd2266b1a01085ede5b9e787845c53d1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = b = c = d$\" width=\"107\" height=\"12\" />.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/c/a6c7ab50d5fc7d2582ca1134a5cfd0d5b75470cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a = a + \\frac{1}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" />, that is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/d/48d02444a59b917b64e8bd0963b88712fc7fa0a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is positive.  Therefore, the only positive solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/8252567c1e737dcfa2d1c5208837e87d51cb6ee5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b, c, d) = (1, 1, 1, 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"174\" height=\"20\" />, and thus the only negative solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/2/2d252beaaa11b7a670ae70c66ae267e9e3598dff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b, c, d) = (-1, -1, -1, -1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"231\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Since the only solutions for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8c31b328eb3b0252134a4720e161c0fdf641e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b, c, d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"75\" height=\"20\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/5/3a507f277b8439592081bc0f39269529b58f9099.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1, 1, 1, 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/6/bf6f1ff10561d4af3f362bb5e20042ec674fdaea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-1, -1, -1, -1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\" />, the only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/1/5712bd3cd6d645baf21805a85fbac6830da247b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(\\mathbf{B})\\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"32\" /> solutions for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/6/a86a21bb08f22880be8848767d68a80a795692ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y, z, w)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"83\" height=\"20\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/2/3828d0e37933a902850f1dfaab0cc2830078388a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sqrt{17}, \\sqrt{17}, \\sqrt{17}, \\sqrt{17})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"174\" height=\"24\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/e/e2e8f2df4636e6f91375082f7a4033e6fe515268.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-\\sqrt{17}, -\\sqrt{17}, -\\sqrt{17}, -\\sqrt{17})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"230\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME\" title=\"1986 AHSME\">1986 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1986 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1986\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">Problem 29</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Question</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_